<p>Your eyes penetrate the darkness to find anyone that may be hiding there. This allows you to see through creeping darkness out to a radius of 10. You can also find your way through the darkness with greater speed (<acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">+75%, +125%, +170%, +211%, +250%</acronym> movement into creeping darkness).</p><p>You do <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">+5%, +9%, +12%, +15%, +17%</acronym> damage to anything that has entered your creeping dark.</p>